<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεουδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fearing God</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί σφιν νόος ἐστὶ θεουδής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.121
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.576
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.176
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεουδέα θυμὸν ἔχοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.364
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλῆος . . ὅς τε θεουδής . .
					εὐδικίας ἀνέχῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.109
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>MAMA</u>
				1.171
			</span></i> (Laodicea Combusta), etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					169
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεο-δϝής</span>
			
				contr.
			 fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεο-δϝεής</span>, compd. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέος</span>: but taken as if 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοειδής</span>
			 by late Poets, as <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.775
			</span></i>.)</div>
